{"name":"Tenzing","hex":"#9ecfd9","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Tenzing","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["Alternative spelling of Tenzin."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Tenzing"}],"entries":[{"title":"Tenzing (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Tenzing is a 2026 biographical drama film directed by Jennifer Peedom and written by Luke Davies. It stars Genden Phuntsok as Tenzing Norgay, Tom Hiddleston as Sir Edmund Hillary, and Willem Dafoe as John Hunt. The film is based on Nepalese-Indian Sherpa Tenzing's 1953 ascent of Mount Everest with New Zealand climber Hillary."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/64/Tenzing_poster.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tenzing_(film)"},{"title":"Tenzing (energy drink)","blocks":[{"text":"Tenzing is an energy drink company founded in the United Kingdom. It is named after Tenzing Norgay, in memory of his achievement of being one of the first people to summit Mount Everest."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/30/A_row_of_Tenzings.jpg/330px-A_row_of_Tenzings.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tenzing_(energy_drink)"},{"title":"Tenzing Norgay","blocks":[{"text":"Tenzing Norgay, born Namgyal Wangdi, and also referred to as Sherpa Tenzing, was a Nepalese-Indian Sherpa mountaineer. On 29 May 1953, he and Edmund Hillary were the first people confirmed to have reached the summit of Mount Everest, as part of the 1953 British Mount Everest expedition. Time named Norgay one of the 100 most influential people of the 20th century."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4b/Tenzing_Norgay_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Tenzing_Norgay_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tenzing_Nor